{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_022_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a0df447d65e3f2b61415420f5b3bc556ba82db0c4defd2093e6c995e3ade6dbd",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_022_23:5_01_022_23_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7dce50170d34528a760ae96a1062f756638cd1fa2c678168dffd9ce12d12f31",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー……辛苦了。\n现在，在工作中……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_022_23:5_01_022_23_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f37d843354cbfdc4af95369d5c7745803ec9b1fd5887e87ad9add322c0ce2df7",
      "text": "没有。正好告一段落了哦。\n有什么事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_022_23:5_01_022_23_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:807dd29c3e3f2811b08d33ecb3bea0fccc7636f101d39546342f4b89c684a52d",
      "text": "太好了……\n情人节的谢礼……想重新向你传达。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_022_23:5_01_022_23_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a81a8219d64a7fd4136aab27546b4f7d06828a6a2423ba13ea735cbe38fdde51",
      "text": "刚才送我的精美巧克力……谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_022_23:5_01_022_23_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86a5531b318f379267fdb87a291ea97d1aded551b83183db9c484576251742a7",
      "text": "今年也能从制作人那里，\n收到巧克力……好开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_022_23:5_01_022_23_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45608da634dde121523197dbc48a7c4a99cb92e08fc981eb2f289d3848111063",
      "text": "吃去年的巧克力时……制作人\n的心意……深深地、传达过来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_022_23:5_01_022_23_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc33666cda26772fe7b42d6c1f4744d3c26046a79cbd7fcba9605fb99535d38e",
      "text": "今年的巧克力……我也会珍惜着吃的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_022_23:5_01_022_23_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e623643bb8f0e1e9aa9ee621c1d5c8d8ea1d4d21694b2214287f4eba0ce3fa4",
      "text": "能听到你这么说，我也很高兴。\n请慢慢品尝哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_022_23:5_01_022_23_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ab54c20070b47d88deddd86873daf2d4910c42be4c9ca5e3146a2d291c81ec6",
      "text": "嗯。我会的……\n品尝它……好期待啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_022_23:5_01_022_23_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e110d139c750656c2a151bebe1f141e111655d4adb8b0c3d87aca67a8a3fa22c",
      "text": "那么……我去训练了。\n制作人……待会儿见。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
